      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "First, you need to cool the burn immediately with cold water for about 10-15 minutes. Then, apply a layer of aloe vera gel or honey directly on the burn to soothe the skin. If the pain persists, you can take a couple of ibuprofen or aspirin, but don't go overboard with the dosage. Remember, if the burn doesn't improve or gets worse, you should seek medical attention. But for now, keep it clean and covered with a sterile bandage. And don't worry, it'll be fine. Just follow these steps and you'll be back to normal in no time.",
